  "description": "My Awesome Web App (version\u202f1.0.0\u2011beta) is a sample ASP.NET web application authored by Alice Johnson and Bob Smith and owned by Acme\u202fCorp. It is described as \u201cA sample ASP.NET web application demonstrating JSON schema compliance\u201d with a short summary of \u201cSample web app\u201d. The package is tagged with\u202fweb,\u202faspnet and\u202fsample, targets the\u202fen\u2011us\u202flocale, and is licensed under the URL\u202fhttps://example.com/license (no license acceptance required). More information can be found at the project URL\u202fhttps://github.com/example/myawesomeapp, and its icon is hosted at\u202fhttps://example.com/icon.png. The web root for the site is the\u202fwwwroot\u202ffolder.\n\nSource files are compiled from the\u202fsrc/**/*.cs\u202fpattern while the build excludes any files under\u202fbin/**/*.*\u202for\u202fobj/**/*.*\u202fand also omits temporary or backup files matching\u202f**/*.tmp\u202fand\u202f**/*.bak. Pre\u2011processing uses\u202fCompiler/Preprocess/**/*.cs, resources are taken from\u202fResources/**/*.resx, and shared code lives in\u202fCompiler/Shared/**/*.cs. The primary commands are\u202frun\u202f\u2192\u202fdotnet run\u202fand\u202ftest\u202f\u2192\u202fdotnet test. Compilation defaults define\u202fTRACE\u202fand\u202fDEBUG, treat warnings as errors, disallow unsafe code, do not optimise, use C#\u202f6, sign with\u202fkey.snk, do not delay\u2011sign, and enable strong\u2011name signing. The Debug configuration overrides these settings with\u202foptimize\u202ffalse and defines\u202fDEBUG; the Release configuration sets\u202foptimize\u202ftrue, treats warnings as errors, and defines\u202fRELEASE.\n\nThe project depends on\u202fNewtonsoft.Json\u202f12.0.3 and\u202fMyLibrary\u202f(version\u202f2.1.0, type\u202fdefault). For the\u202fnet5.0\u202fframework it also requires\u202fMicrosoft.AspNetCore.App\u202f(version\u202f5.0.0, type\u202fdefault), uses C#\u202f5 for compilation, and includes the framework assembly\u202fSystem.Net.Http\u202f4.3.0. Build scripts run\u202fecho\u202fPre\u2011pack script\u202fbefore packing, then after packing execute\u202fdotnet clean\u202fand\u202fecho\u202fPost\u2011pack done; the\u202fprepare\u202fstage runs\u202fgit submodule update --init. The repository is a Git source at\u202fhttps://github.com/example/myawesomeapp.git. A custom resource named\u202flogo\u202fmaps to\u202fResources/Images/logo.png. Release notes state: \u201cInitial beta release with core functionalities.\u201d"
